IDV SDK Document Verification Requested Your identity needs to be verified. Please tap below to begin. Verify Now Verification Complete Your identity has been verified successfully. Okay
//QrScanner Please scan the above QR code
//GovernmentID (Including both License and Passport) Scan your ID Scan your government-issued ID. Make sure your camera is clean and the ID is clearly visible. Confirm ID Type We couldn\'t identify your ID.\nSelect the ID type to continue. Driver\'s License Passport Passport Card Other
//Location Share your Location Your location is needed to complete identity verification. Try Again
//Selfie Take a Selfie Make sure you can see your face in the oval.
//Email Verify Your Email Enter your email address. Please choose your email address Email to be verified Email Address
//Phone Verify Your Phone Enter your phone number. Please choose your phone number Phone number to be verified Enter phone number Select a country Search
//OTP Verification Code Enter the code sent to: Verification Code expires in %1$s
//Buttons Skip Continue Submit Next Retry Cancel Resend Yes, Continue No, Retake
%1$d min %1$d sec Session expires in %1$s Location Access is Required You must share your location to complete identity verification.
